                "loc": "DEU.14.22+DEU.14.23+DEU.14.24+DEU.14.25+DEU.14.26+DEU.14.27+DEU.14.28+DEU.14.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lodo 14.22-29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Acel me apar luŋ ame oya i lobo, kadi gin ame oceki poto onyo nyig yen onyak, mannono luŋ jami a Rwot, gin acil baŋ Rwot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka ce dano moro mito lakoro ginnoro i kom acel me apar, en bino medo acel me abic iye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Acel me apar me dok kede romi kede dyegi luŋ, acel me apar me leyi luŋ akato i te abiro akwat, gin luŋ bino bedo acil baŋ Rwot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wonnere mom bino penyo ka ber onyo rac, dok daŋ mom bino loko i moro ocele; ka ce en aloko, gin aryo luŋ ame olokogi-nono myero bed acil; mom obino lakoro.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.33"
            ]
          }
        }
